1
00:00:00,172 --> 00:00:03,592
(Sheldon:)You laugh now,
you just wait until you need tech support.

2
00:00:05,261 --> 00:00:07,551
(Penny:)Gosh. He's kind of a sore loser, isn't he?

3
00:00:07,722 --> 00:00:11,222
(Leonard:)Well, to be fair,
he's also a rather unpleasant winner.

4
00:00:11,392 --> 00:00:13,222
(Penny:)Well, it's been fun.

5
00:00:13,394 --> 00:00:15,184
(Leonard:)Penny, we make such a good team.

6
00:00:15,354 --> 00:00:18,144
(Leonard:)Maybe we could enter
a couple of "Halo" tournaments sometime.

7
00:00:18,691 --> 00:00:21,111
(Penny:)Or we could just have a life.

8
00:00:22,194 --> 00:00:24,784
(Leonard:)I guess for you, that's an option.
Ha-ha. Ha.

9
00:00:25,239 --> 00:00:26,739
- Good night, Leonard.
- Good night.

10
00:00:26,907 --> 00:00:29,407
(Penny:)As usual, nice talking to you, Raj.

11
00:00:30,786 --> 00:00:32,876
(Raj:)What do you suppose she meant by that?

12
00:00:33,873 --> 00:00:35,503
(Leonard:)She's an enigma, Raj.

13
00:00:36,292 --> 00:00:39,252
(Sheldon:)There's a certain ethic to the game,
Penny, a well-established...

14
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,250
(Leonard:)She's gone, Sheldon.

15
00:00:42,089 --> 00:00:43,969
(Sheldon:)Well, she could have said goodbye.

16
00:00:45,051 --> 00:00:47,221
(Penny(entering again):)Okay, I have a problem.

17
00:00:47,386 --> 00:00:50,636
(Sheldon:)It's called carpal tunnel syndrome,
and quite frankly, you deserve it.

18
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:53,390
(Leonard:)What's wrong?

19
00:00:53,559 --> 00:01:00,019
Well, um, Howard and Christy
are kind of hooking up in my bedroom.

